# Experiment outputs.
# Result CSV/JSON artifacts that back numbers in the paper ARE tracked
# (reproducibility requirement from the 2026-08-16 academic review); only
# bulky binaries and scratch caches stay ignored.
experiments/**/*.h5
experiments/figures/*.pdf
experiments/figures/*.png
!experiments/**/README.md

# Paper build artifacts
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.toc
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls

